@act_berlin_organise
title: Build factory cells and recruit
subtitle: Organisation +5 × m. Costs 1 resource.
view-if: x_berlin_organise = 1
choose-if: c_berlin_organise = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_berlin_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_berlin_cd <= 0 : Needs 1 resource. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'berlin', 'organise'); !}
new-page: true

= Build factory cells and recruit

Organisers go from works gate to works gate in Berlin. New cells meet in back rooms after the shift. The dues book fills slowly, and so does the list of names the police would like to have.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="berlin"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_berlin_struggle
title: Lead a strike or an unemployed march
subtitle: Organisation +2 × m, strikes +1, pressure rises. The Left gains.
view-if: x_berlin_struggle = 1
choose-if: c_berlin_struggle = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_berlin_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_berlin_cd <= 0 : Needs organisation 25 here. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'berlin', 'struggle'); !}
new-page: true

= Lead a strike or an unemployed march

In Berlin the party calls the workers out: a strike over the wage the inflation ate this week, a march of the unemployed to the town hall. The employers answer with lockouts and the police with batons, and the workers see who stood with them.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="berlin"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_berlin_front
title: Build the united front with SPD and union workers
subtitle: United front actions +1. Costs 1 resource. The Right gains, the Left grumbles.
view-if: x_berlin_front = 1
choose-if: c_berlin_front = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_berlin_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_berlin_cd <= 0 : Needs 1 resource and organisation 20 here. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'berlin', 'front'); !}
new-page: true

= Build the united front with SPD and union workers

In Berlin our cells go to the SPD and union branches with a concrete proposal, not a lecture: a joint meeting, a joint demand, a joint committee. Some branch secretaries refuse. Some of their members come anyway.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="berlin"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_berlin_defence
title: Form a unit of the Proletarian Hundreds
subtitle: Hundreds +1 here. Pressure rises sharply. Costs 1 resource.
view-if: x_berlin_defence = 1
choose-if: c_berlin_defence = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_berlin_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_berlin_cd <= 0 : Needs 1 resource and organisation 30 here. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'berlin', 'defence'); !}
new-page: true

= Form a unit of the Proletarian Hundreds

A new unit of the Proletarian Hundreds forms in Berlin: workers from the same works, drilling at night with what weapons they have. Today they protect meetings. What they will be asked to do tomorrow is a question the party has not yet answered.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="berlin"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_berlin_control
title: Set up price control committees
subtitle: Organisation +3 × m; housewives and the unemployed come to us.
view-if: x_berlin_control = 1
choose-if: c_berlin_control = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_berlin_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_berlin_cd <= 0 : Needs organisation 35 here. ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'berlin', 'control'); !}
new-page: true

= Set up price control committees

Control committees of workers and housewives go to the markets of Berlin, check prices and hoards, and post the names of the profiteers. The police call it vigilantism. The queues call it the first sensible thing anyone has done.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="berlin"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_berlin_mayday
