view-if: x_berlin_mayday = 1
choose-if: c_berlin_mayday = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if d_berlin_cd > 0 : We acted here this turn. ?][? if d_berlin_cd <= 0 :  ?]
on-arrival: {! window.KPD.act(Q, 'berlin', 'mayday'); !}
new-page: true

= Hold May Day in Munich against the leagues

On the first of May the workers of Munich march, while the völkisch leagues gather under arms on the Oberwiesenfeld. This time the state holds the leagues back, and the workers see that they can be faced.

{!<div class="kpd-insert" data-insert="district" data-arg="berlin"></div>!}

- @root: Continue.

@act_berlin_border
title: Watch the Bavarian border with the Thuringian Hundreds
